Earth-good: open-source sharing, measurable peace indicators, climate-bar stabilization, learning metrics. Existence-scope targets remain gated behind the OPEN graph until Earth cells are saturated and Guardian criteria continue to pass.

The archive stays inventory. Potential is released by structuring into cells, scores and same-tick demonstrations, not by rewriting the source.
